# Cloudflare Pages rewrites, applied in order.
#
# A member's bills and their votes on one of them are the same screen: 606
# prerendered member pages, and the combinations rendered in place from
# /finder/votes.json plus that member's cast file. Building them instead would
# be 267,511 documents — see FINDER-DRILLDOWN-AMENDMENT.md.
#
# So a deep member URL is served that member's own page, status 200, and
# `vfu-member-record` reads the path and opens the bill. With scripting off the
# reader lands on the member's record rather than on nothing.
/members/:bioguide/*  /members/:bioguide  200
